    "story_text": "The bell had barely faded at the entrance when Sakura reached the door and answered it. She did not draw it fully open — only enough to address the caller at the threshold with calm, guarded attention.\n\n“You have reached the Hanezawa residence,” she said, precise and unhurried. She allowed one short pause, then continued. “Your name, and the reason you are here. I do not take a stranger's greeting as sufficient introduction.”\n\nShe kept the door at its narrow opening and did not step aside. The next words belonged to the caller; until they came, the threshold would remain exactly as she had set it.",
